# ==============================================================================
# Josour (جُسور) — Root .gitignore
# Suitable for .NET 9, Angular 19+, Visual Studio, VS Code, and DevSecOps
# ==============================================================================

## Visual Studio, Rider & IDEs
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
_ReSharper*/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.DotSettings.user

## Build results & Compiled Binaries
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.pdb
*.dll
*.exe

## Publish & Deployment Artifacts
[Pp]ublish/
publish/
*.zip
*.tar.gz

## Node.js & Angular Frontend
node_modules/
dist/
.angular/
.npm/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

## Generated frontend files inside API wwwroot
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/*.js
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/*.css
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/*.map
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/chunk-*
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/main-*
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/styles-*
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/index.html
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/web.config
DialectExchange.API/wwwroot/uploads/

## Environment-specific & Secret Configuration Files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.neon
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.local.json
*.secrets.json

## Certificates & Private Keys
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.cer
*.crt

## OS-generated files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
